      "content": "counseling won't change the fact that the money isn't there. i've looked at the numbers a thousand times. even with a plan, it'll take years and years of living in misery just to break even, and i'm already at my breaking point. honestly, it just seems like there's no \"practical plan\" that fixes the shame of it all. every option just leads back to more struggle. i just want the noise to stop. i want to stop feeling like a failure every second of the day. there just isn't a way to make it okay again.",
